Cell["\<\
The data is not stationary. An integrated model of order 1 would make the \
time series stationary but so would a seasonal model of period 12 months. \
Both Integrated and Seasonal components may not be required in the model.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.93029796193853*^9, 3.9302979878107185`*^9}, {
  3.93175567240361*^9, 
  3.9317558064449863`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"84a918a0-03ba-3b42-9ea5-\
f621cd609287"],

