Cell["\<\
From the ACF plot we see that we have a strong seasonal pattern repeating at \
12 lags.
The PACF shows potentially an order 2 on the auto-regressive model at lag 1 \
and lag 3. The rapid decay from lag 1 to lag 2 is an indication that there is \
no moving average component.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.931755316365303*^9, 3.9317553963866405`*^9}, {
  3.931755444529545*^9, 3.9317554797476845`*^9}, {3.9317562090499535`*^9, 
  3.9317562237121105`*^9}, {3.9317563665407963`*^9, 3.9317563728291683`*^9}, {
  3.9317564429326935`*^9, 
  3.9317565042477684`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d6776691-f03b-2c41-aac0-\
5818b69f4363"],

